# Sweep 2b 0.3 / 2.1 — the Map under a HAND-shaped trackpad session (rperf `trackpad`: may-begin, two axes, jitter,
# holds, momentum, re-swipes, pointer wobble). Realistic test library; the 6th collection holds 12 entries (a dozen
# orbs, as T's 12:25 recording). Before the trackpad: switch views and rest the Map several times (T's state, 0.4).
# Read with explain.py (Map frames per second) — RED = Map updates < 60 in a pan second, or a .changed while paused.
lib          click sidebar.library
view-map     click toolbar.view.Map
rest         wait 4000
view-list    click toolbar.view.List
view-map     click toolbar.view.Map
rest         wait 6000
view-cards   click toolbar.view.Cards
view-map     click toolbar.view.Map
rest         wait 6000
col12        click sidebar.collection#5
rest         wait 4000
col-plain    trackpad 700,560 8 nomomentum
rest         wait 3000
col-hand     trackpad 700,560 15 hold wobble
rest         wait 6000
lib2         click sidebar.library
rest         wait 4000
lib-hand     trackpad 700,560 15 hold wobble
rest         wait 6000
